<title>CHINA: China builds largest shipyard in Dalian.</title>
<headline>China builds largest shipyard in Dalian.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>China has built its largest shipyard with a capacity of 300,000 tonnes in the northern city of Dalian, Shanghai's Business News said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The shipyard is 365 metres (1,197 feet) long, 80 metres (262 feet) wide and 12.7 metres (42 feet) deep, the newspaper said, adding that the shipyard is equipped with a 900-tonne hoist, the biggest in Asia.</p>
<p>It gave no more details.</p>
